      "risk_review": {
        "status": "complete",
        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-46",
        "notes": "Read steps 1.1–4.1 and exact finite blocks in def-qft-dirac-projections and units in def-qft-example-data. Pauli products give Clifford h=(+---), gamma5 kills odd traces, trace(P)=2 and H^2=E^2 establish rank two. Right multiplication by beta gives both completeness signs and adjoint current identity. E>0 excludes only the massless apex; M=0 at nonzero momentum is valid. Finite Gaussian elimination and Gram–Schmidt need no additional choice. Reader/refuter contain no findings. Full transitive foundational audit and supplier readiness are not claimed."
