        "reviewer": "alpha-batch-46",
        "notes": "Read all six steps, typed phase-space definition, and complete published Borel substitution and sphere-measure arguments. Boost spatial Jacobian Eprime/E is positive on D_M, including punctured massless domain; rotations fix energy. Rest-frame choice differs by rotation. Strict threshold yields unique positive radial root with derivative kstar sqrt(s)/(E1 E2); stated delta notation is defined as iterated evaluation, not a distribution product. Density kstar/(16 pi^2 sqrt(s)), total kstar/(4 pi sqrt(s)), flux 4 pstar sqrt(s), and identical decay factor 1/(32 pi hbar M0) check. Scattering map requires positive flux; threshold and zero-flux cross sections are excluded, massless daughters allowed. Reader/refuter no findings; no completed-measurable substitution or survival law is used."
